1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,600
BLOND NOBLEMAN: What is it?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,500
THE FORMER GROOM: There is a rumor going around, my Lord.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,600
BLOND NOBLEMAN: What rumor?

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,300
THE FORMER GROOM: About a war veteran. Some say he resembles the late Duke.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,500
BLOND NOBLEMAN: People see ghosts whenever they want a story.

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,400
THE FORMER GROOM: The man is said to have the same kind of scar the Duke carried after the war.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,100
BLOND NOBLEMAN: Where?

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,800
THE FORMER GROOM: No one seems certain.

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,100
BLOND NOBLEMAN: Then let it remain a rumor.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,400
BLOND NOBLEMAN: Impossible.
